    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. it's just that there's no point to any of it anymore. every single day is exactly the same. i wake up, i do the chores, i watch him fade, i go to sleep. it feels like i've already died, i'm just stuck in this body until the timing works out. it's like i'm just a ghost haunting my own house.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
