      "content": "idk if a professional can even help with this. it’s not like i’m depressed or something, it’s just... the reality of it. he's going, and i'm just here watching it happen. it feels so hollow. sometimes i look at him and i just think, wouldn't it be so much more peaceful if it was just over? for both of us? just a quiet end to the waiting.",
